      "text": "进攻连线显示双方关联，并避让战斗信息条；移动端排序区的卡牌、提示与确认操作分别可达，不再相互遮挡。",
      "paths": ["opcgpro-vue/src/l12/game/AttackConnectionPresentationLayer.vue", "opcgpro-vue/src/l12/game/attackConnectionPresentation.ts", "opcgpro-vue/src/l12/game/PromptOverlay.vue"]
